'''Notes:'''
* On ABC, ''[[Grand Ole Opry]]'' made its debut as a monthly series, airing 8–9 p.m. from October 15, 1955, to September 26, 1956. On CBS, ''[[Ford Star Jubilee]]'' made its debut as a monthly series, airing 9:30–11 p.m. On NBC, ''[[Max Liebman Presents]]'' aired as a monthly series, 9–10:30&nbsp;p.m.
*''[[High Finance (1956 TV series)|High Finance]]'', hosted by [[Dennis James]], debuted on July 7, 1956, at 10:30 on CBS. It ran until December 15, 1956. It replaced ''The Damon Runyon Theater.''
*On NBC, the 1956 version of the summer series ''[[Encore Theatre]]'' consisted of reruns of episodes of ''[[Pepsi Cola Playhouse]]'' and ''[[Studio 57]]''.

